text: {The Conclave's researchers need someone to cast their newest spell for the first time. The walls are thick for a reason.|Someone has chalked a new circle on the floor. The old one is scorched.|You know every scorch mark in the chamber by now, and who made each one.} {Today's spell is meant to make a candle burn backwards.|Today's spell is meant to tidy a room. It has opinions about what tidy means.|Today's spell is unnamed. Nobody will say why.}
