text: {You've been asked to take the minutes of a Conclave research committee. There are nine members, and none of them ever agrees.|The committee is still arguing about last time's question, and now about the minutes too.|You could take these minutes in your sleep, and some of the committee do attend them that way.} {Two of them are not speaking to each other, and want it recorded.|One of them asks what you think.|One of them falls asleep, and wakes up to vote.}
> left: Offer an opinion when asked
  wage
