text: {The instruments have to go up to the ridge before dark, and the air on the plateau is very thin.|Your legs know the path now. Your lungs are still negotiating.|You've carried things up this ridge so often that the goats have stopped looking at you.} {season == "winter": {Snow has drifted against the path.|The wind cuts through every layer you own.|Ice has glazed the steps cut into the rock.}|{The rocks are still hot from the afternoon.|The sky is clear all the way to the top of the world.|The evening wind smells of thyme and stone.}}
