  say: {You work the night's sums by lamplight, warm and quiet. The lamp gutters twice. Your sums don't.|You have the charts ready when they come down. Nobody thanks you, because the charts are always ready.|You do the sums in the tent, as usual. The numbers are good, and so is the stove.}

@event intern_expedition_chart_dispute
title: A Star Out of Place
track: intern_expedition
class: routine
