text: {Your chart and the senior astronomer's disagree about where one faint star is.|The senior astronomer's charts and yours have a running disagreement now, kept in red ink.|The senior astronomer now checks your charts first. A compliment, possibly.} {Probably your hand shook.|Probably their eyesight.|Probably the thin air.} {season == "winter": The nights are long, with time to recheck everything.|The nights are short, and every hour counts.}
> left: Recheck it all night
