    say: {The astronomer checks, grumbles and corrects their chart. Then they buy you a cup of the camp's terrible coffee.|"Well spotted," says the astronomer, through their teeth.|You raise it, and the astronomer has already checked it. "You first, this time," they say.}
  else:
