text: {The Thornwick students have questions about Lumenhold. Most of them are about the last time the two schools met on the duelling field.|The Thornwick students have found a new angle on the old grudge.|You and the Thornwick students have a routine now. It's almost friendly.} {Today they want to know if Lumenhold's towers still lean.|Today they ask, sweetly, if Lumenhold teaches illusion yet.|Today one of them pretends to be you, very well.}
> left: Out-charm them
